OL,3,GNEWSAYellow wind warning for millions
OL,4,Ain UK as Storm Austen sees thousands
OL,5,Alose power in South West England
OL,6,
OL,7,FA yellow weather warning for wind is
OL,8,Fnow in place across England and Wales
OL,9,Fas Storm Austen hits parts of the UK
OL,11,FJersey and Guernsey remain under a red
OL,12,Fwarning while an amber warning for
OL,13,FCornwall and parts of Devon has expired
OL,15,FMore than 18,000 homes in Wales,
OL,16,FCornwall, Devon and parts of England
OL,17,Fare affected by power cuts as the
OL,18,Fstormy weather causes travel disruption
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
