OL,3,GNEWSAYellow wind warning for millions
OL,4,Ain UK as Storm Austen sees thousands
OL,5,Alose power in South West England
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn France, Storm Austen is causing
OL,8,Fsevere transport problems in coastal
OL,9,Fregions in the north-west - with
OL,10,Fthousands without power and some ferry
OL,11,Fservices from the UK cancelled
OL,13,FOn Saturday, a separate storm, named
OL,14,FBoelo, is forecast to bring more strong
OL,15,Fwinds to Scotland and Northern Ireland
OL,16,Fas well as North West and North East
OL,17,FEngland
